<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CCRICKET-FREE STATE WERE 176-4 AT TEA VS BOLAND.</title>
<headline>CCRICKET-FREE STATE WERE 176-4 AT TEA VS BOLAND.</headline>
<dateline>PAARL 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State were 176 for four from 70 overs at tea in their four day Supersport Series match against Boland in Paarl on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Free State 176 for four from 70 overs against Boland</p>
